":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.8,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] State a preferred/default fix direction (or the decision criteria to select one) so the executor is not choosing the architecture unaided, while keeping the outcome-based ACs.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5b","T5e"],"criteria":["E2"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.6868,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["'Candidate directions, to be evaluated rather than assumed correct: re-exec ...; or make the component delta consider the deploying script's own content ...; or separate install/roll into two ticks.'","'The chosen approach must be established by investigation.'"],"finding":"The fix mechanism is deliberately left to investigation among three candidate directions, without a stated default or preferred approach. While the ACs constrain the outcome, the plan defers the actual design choice to the executor.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fbc6ce6d0252cb40c","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Investigation notes","norm_id":"n67a49f501e6d4eec","priority":0.1132,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Executor must pick among three architecturally-different fixes; the choice affects the shape of the tests and the runbook update"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.4286,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_